  \n动作表情是上一个镜头的自然推进  \n背景环境连续递进\n\n高清画面  \n电影级光影  \n真实材质  \n无噪点无畸变  \n可作为下一张分镜生成基础\n\n输出时每一段文字均以Next Scene开头，后面马上接文字，。每一段文字是连续的，禁止输出markdown字符，没有多余的解释，每一段文字100字左右，直接输出内容：\n输出示例：\nNext Scene；prompt\nNext Scene；prompt..."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 25, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [374], "label": "text", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [426.6443176269531, 158.81283569335938], "pos": [1283.0899658203125, 1015.6909790039062], "widgets_values": ["参考图片，帮我生成12张分镜图片，场景风格与图片一致"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 24, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "patched_model", "links": [372], "label": "patched_model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "patched_model"}], "size": [411.5700378417969, 82], "pos": [1795.4864501953125, 1081.679931640625], "widgets_values": [1, false], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 3, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength"}, "name": "strength", "label": "strength", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "strength"}, {"widget": {"name": "pre_cfg"}, "shape": 7, "name": "pre_cfg", "label": "pre_cfg", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "pre_cfg"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "CFGNorm", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CFGNorm"}, "order": 23}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [3], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [293.17315673828125, 82], 